      "content": "i dont think anyone actually sees me anymore. they see the scandal. they see the headlines. even my family... it feels like they're just performing being okay. i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. how am i supposed to just 'grieve' when there's literally nothing left to build on? the foundation is just... gone.",
